<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2352] IGFS shows incorrect file modification time when running over secondary file system.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2352</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Steps to reproduce:&lt;br/&gt;
1) Create a file in a secondary file system.&lt;br/&gt;
2) Access this file directly and observe creation date X.&lt;br/&gt;
3) Now access this file indirectly through IGFS and observe that it will have different creation date Y. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We need to make such properties equal.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12929131">IGNITE-2352</key>
            <summary>IGFS shows incorrect file modification time when running over secondary file system.</summary>
